Help For The Frequency Entry

Frequency entry

Type the new frequency in megahertz, then press Enter. Use a decimal point for fractions of a megahertz. YAC applies a supported value immediately and confirms the frequency by reading the radio.
Type h, then Enter, to read this help and return to frequency entry without changing anything.
Blank Enter cancels with Aborted. An unacceptable value gives Invalid. Both end the request without changing the frequency and return to the main controls. Press e to try again.

